    "created_at": "2023-08-25T09:22:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-25T09:22:17Z",
    "body": "It's a UI manner which means it's intentionally somewhat vague at a high level. However, we could probably provide more guidance here. I think ensuring that the end user knows what ends up being shared is important. You could imagine UIs for that work even when the eventual controls are hidden, but they're not necessarily the most ergonomic.\r\n\r\ncc @battre @hsinyi ",
